{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih al Bukhari","section":{"3":{"eng-name":"Knowledge","ara-name":"كتاب العلم"}},"section_detail":{"3":{"hadithnumber_first":59,"hadithnumber_last":134,"arabicnumber_first":59,"arabicnumber_last":134}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":113,"arabicnumber":113,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Huraira : Aucun compagnon du Prophète (ﷺ) n’a rapporté plus de hadiths que moi, sauf `Abdullah bin `Amr (bin Al-`As) qui les écrivait, alors que moi je ne le faisais pas","grades":[{"name":"Imam Bukhari","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":3,"hadith":55},"chapter":{"id":39,"ara-name":"باب كِتَابَةِ الْعِلْمِ","eng-name":"The writing of knowledge","isFirstHadith":false}}]}